-- ako/mxcli#1911 (mendixlabs/mxcli#1716): DROP ASSOCIATION parsed and executed
-- but `mxcli syntax` documented it nowhere a reader would look. The statements
-- below are spelled exactly as the new `mxcli syntax drop` topic lists them.
mdl 1;
DROP ASSOCIATION IF EXISTS BugTest.Order_Customer;
DROP ENTITY IF EXISTS BugTest.OrderLine;
DROP MICROFLOW IF EXISTS BugTest.ACT_Old;
DROP NANOFLOW IF EXISTS BugTest.NF_Old;
DROP SNIPPET IF EXISTS BugTest.SN_Old;
